4. The Mixolydian Mode
== ===================

The MIXOLYDIAN mode has semitone 6 as its home note (G in the white-note
scale); interval sequence TTS T TST.  In A, it's AB^cde^fga.  In sol-fa,
it's the so-mode.

X:0
T:The Mixolydian (so) Scale
M:10/4
L:1/4
K:GMix
